# TooieRecomp local patch (applies to lib/N64ModernRuntime/N64Recomp, base pin 2b6f0568 + 3 n64recomp patches above). Opens every generated-output ofstream (funcs_N.c, funcs.h, lookup.cpp, recomp_overlays.inl, dumped context files, per-function temp output, RSPRecomp output) with std::ios::binary so Windows does not translate LF to CRLF and RecompiledFuncs/ is byte-identical to the Linux-generated metadata/recomp-output.sha256. No emitted content changes.
